                    357.0,
                    744.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) If such an employee subsequently accepts a promotion to another Occupational Job Classification within the bargaining unit, he or she may be retained on the Employee Resource Center assignment. In such case, the employee will be assigned the Occupational Job Classification and wages which would have been applicable on the Occupational Job Classification to which promoted.",
